// Ch12 B07 "The herd-cord" (E, 1 min). The seep's light leaves the fallen Ram and rises quickly (rule 2).
// Kerrid kneels and unties the herd-cord (animals shied from him all game; this one is past shying) and
// hands it to Pell, who reads the knots by touch. Pell ties it onto the nearest pass-cord; they walk on
// without looking back.
title: ch12_herd_cord
location: ch12/keth_pass
---
@camera P07
@vfx glimmer_lift at=avalanche_ram count=10 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@wait 2.5
@anim kerrid kneel avalanche_ram
@anim kerrid give pell
@wait 2.0
@anim pell read_knots
Pell [neutral]: Three names. The herder's family. #line:ch12_cord_001
@wait 1.5
Pell [sad]: Somebody loved this animal. #line:ch12_cord_002
@anim pell tie_knot pass_cord
@wait 2.0
<<set $ch12_ram_felled = true>>
===
